{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Have corrupted</b> — their way." "<b>And have done abominably</b> — with the yoke of their deeds [i.e., in their deeds]. The bet is missing, as in: 'Is the house of YHWH found' [i.e., בית ה' written defectively]. I have explained the verses in the first psalm [Psalm 14]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 53, :notes {1 "The phrase בעול שיעשו is unusual; rendered hyper-literally as 'with the yoke of their deeds.' The reference is to Psalm 14, the parallel version of this psalm. The bet missing refers to התעיבו being understood as if from a root with a bet."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:13.381906470Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}